{#- The house's monogram: its initials in hairline capitals inside a pearl oval drawn with one rose line. It is the
    client's own mark (their initials); it never imitates an assay office mark, a hallmark or any house's logo.
    Set `cartoucheClass` for size. -#}
<svg class="nc-cartouche {{ cartoucheClass }}" viewBox="0 0 64 42" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse class="nc-cartouche-o" cx="32" cy="21" rx="31" ry="20"/><text x="32.6" y="27.6" text-anchor="middle">{{ site.business.name | monogram }}</text></svg>
